{"org":"elastic","repo":"elasticsearch","prNumber":"122031","commit":"b8b8b0db3849b5a252489fdc1160fb8c9e1f9d25","generatedCommentsNodes":[{"comment":"The nesting of `assertBusy` calls creates a redundant and confusing timeout mechanism that contradicts the documentation in `#RZ50A`. The outer loop waits up to 1 minute, but since it wraps an inner `assertBusy` (which defaults to a 10-second timeout), the actual total wall-clock time spent waiting could significantly exceed one minute. A single `assertBusy` call with the desired duration is sufficient and more predictable.","nodes":[{"id":"x-pack/plugin/analytics/src/javaRestTest/java/org/elasticsearch/multiterms/AggsTimeoutIT.java-x-pack/plugin/analytics/src/javaRestTest/java/org/elasticsearch/multiterms/AggsTimeoutIT.java-11971:12017,12026:12067,12076:12111,12120:12384-12460:13123","promptId":"#KM0Z6","srcPath":"x-pack/plugin/analytics/src/javaRestTest/java/org/elasticsearch/multiterms/AggsTimeoutIT.java","dstPath":"x-pack/plugin/analytics/src/javaRestTest/java/org/elasticsearch/multiterms/AggsTimeoutIT.java","srcChanges":[{"pos":11971,"endPos":12017,"startLine":291,"startLineOffset":8,"endLine":291,"endLineOffset":54,"length":47},{"pos":12026,"endPos":12067,"startLine":292,"startLineOffset":8,"endLine":292,"endLineOffset":49,"length":42},{"pos":12076,"endPos":12111,"startLine":293,"startLineOffset":8,"endLine":293,"endLineOffset":43,"length":36},{"pos":12120,"endPos":12384,"startLine":294,"startLineOffset":8,"endLine":298,"endLineOffset":11,"length":265}],"dstChanges":[{"pos":12460,"endPos":13123,"startLine":302,"startLineOffset":8,"endLine":314,"endLineOffset":32,"length":664}]},{"id":"x-pack/plugin/analytics/src/javaRestTest/java/org/elasticsearch/multiterms/AggsTimeoutIT.java-x-pack/plugin/analytics/src/javaRestTest/java/org/elasticsearch/multiterms/AggsTimeoutIT.java--11984:12389","promptId":"#RZ50A","srcPath":"x-pack/plugin/analytics/src/javaRestTest/java/org/elasticsearch/multiterms/AggsTimeoutIT.java","dstPath":"x-pack/plugin/analytics/src/javaRestTest/java/org/elasticsearch/multiterms/AggsTimeoutIT.java","srcChanges":[],"dstChanges":[{"pos":11984,"endPos":12389,"startLine":292,"startLineOffset":4,"endLine":300,"endLineOffset":7,"length":406}]}]},{"comment":"Calling `hotThreads()` inside the inner polling loop of `assertBusy` will cause excessive network traffic and log spam. Because `assertBusy` uses exponential backoff to poll frequently, a search that takes several seconds to terminate will trigger numerous requests to `/_nodes/hot_threads` and flood the logs with warnings. This diagnostic information should ideally be captured only once upon final failure rather than on every polling iteration.","nodes":[{"id":"x-pack/plugin/analytics/src/javaRestTest/java/org/elasticsearch/multiterms/AggsTimeoutIT.java-x-pack/plugin/analytics/src/javaRestTest/java/org/elasticsearch/multiterms/AggsTimeoutIT.java-11971:12017,12026:12067,12076:12111,12120:12384-12460:13123","promptId":"#KM0Z6","srcPath":"x-pack/plugin/analytics/src/javaRestTest/java/org/elasticsearch/multiterms/AggsTimeoutIT.java","dstPath":"x-pack/plugin/analytics/src/javaRestTest/java/org/elasticsearch/multiterms/AggsTimeoutIT.java","srcChanges":[{"pos":11971,"endPos":12017,"startLine":291,"startLineOffset":8,"endLine":291,"endLineOffset":54,"length":47},{"pos":12026,"endPos":12067,"startLine":292,"startLineOffset":8,"endLine":292,"endLineOffset":49,"length":42},{"pos":12076,"endPos":12111,"startLine":293,"startLineOffset":8,"endLine":293,"endLineOffset":43,"length":36},{"pos":12120,"endPos":12384,"startLine":294,"startLineOffset":8,"endLine":298,"endLineOffset":11,"length":265}],"dstChanges":[{"pos":12460,"endPos":13123,"startLine":302,"startLineOffset":8,"endLine":314,"endLineOffset":32,"length":664}]},{"id":"x-pack/plugin/analytics/src/javaRestTest/java/org/elasticsearch/multiterms/AggsTimeoutIT.java-x-pack/plugin/analytics/src/javaRestTest/java/org/elasticsearch/multiterms/AggsTimeoutIT.java--13135:13337","prom